WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.920
The writer is revising an essay about Chandragupta Maurya’s capital.

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:04.030
Select the sentence claiming that archaeologists found all 64 gates.

00:00:04.030 --> 00:00:07.300
Choose Ask Beside about selection in TextEdit’s Services menu.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:15.680
Ask whether the dig found the gates and check the claim against the research notes.

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:17.530
The excavation exposed timber. Megasthenes described the 64 gates.

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:21.160
Check the passages from both research notes, then return to the essay.

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:24.713
Paste the corrected sentence into TextEdit and save the revision.
